@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Project";
}

<div class="page-header">
    <div>
        <h1>Project</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">Codebase yang dikenal AIT. Identitas unik = folder root project (berisi <span class="mono">.git</span> atau file build seperti <span class="mono">.sln</span>, <span class="mono">pom.xml</span>, <span class="mono">package.json</span>), sehingga banyak sesi dari project berbeda tidak saling tercampur.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
        <p class="small text-secondary mb-2">
            Project terdaftar otomatis pada prompt pertama dari sesi yang dibuka di folder project (atau di dalamnya).
            Sesi di folder tanpa marker project <strong>diabaikan</strong> AIT — prompt-nya diteruskan langsung tanpa orkestrasi dan tanpa memory.
            Pengarahan CLI coding (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, …) ke proxy ini (per project atau global) diatur di menu <a asp-controller="Cli" asp-action="Index">CLI</a>.
        </p>
        <label class="form-label small text-secondary" for="projectPath">Daftarkan manual</label>
        <div class="input-group">
            <input type="text" class="form-control mono" id="projectPath" placeholder="D:\Source\MyApp (folder project)" />
            <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button" id="btnBrowse">Telusuri…</button>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" id="btnRegister">Daftarkan</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0 table-clickable">
            <thead>
                <tr><th>Project</th><th>Stack</th><th>Thread</th><th>Sesi</th><th>Memory</th><th>Terakhir dipakai</th><th></th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="projectRows"><tr><td colspan="7" class="empty-state">Memuat…</td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    <div class="card-footer d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center small d-none" id="projectPager"></div>
</div>

<partial name="_ProjectBrowser" />

@section Scripts {
    <script src="~/js/project-browser.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
    <script src="~/js/pages/projects.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}
